ezone based on the user. The date offset isn’t IANA standard. I could list absolute times for tomorrow’s local date, but guessing the zone is risky. If I can retrieve the system timezone, I might read from /etc/localtime for that info. It could be better to establish a broad window for events, like listing from Nov 9 to Nov 11 in UTC, then refine based on the event's timezone.\"}]},{\"type\":\"function_call\",\"id\":\"fc_02d71b7a964e1c6e016af13c547d3487d0a972255fee4488e1\",\"call_id\":\"call_rF7eaqoJZKeIJ4e2y1msldMg\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"arguments\":\"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"tools run <<'JS'\\\\nconst results = await Promise.all([tools.mail.read({message:\\\\\\\"msg_304633ba80d547b5\\\\\\\"}),tools.calendar.list({from:\\\\\\\"2026-11-09T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\",to:\\\\\\\"2026-11-11T00:00:00Z\\\\\\\"})]); results.forEach((result,i)=>console.log(JSON.stringify({kind:i===0?\\\\\\\"mail\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"calendar\\\\\\\",result})));\\\\nJS\\\",\\\"timeout\\\":null}\"},{\"type\":\"function_call_output\",\"call_id\":\"call_rF7eaqoJZKeIJ4e2y1msldMg\",\"output\":\"{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"mail\\\",\\\"result\\\":{\\\"messages\\\":[{\\\"message\\\":\\\"msg_304633ba80d547b5\\\",\\\"thread\\\":\\\"thr_eecaafe17f4d4a8c\\\",\\\"from\\\":{\\\"email\\\":\\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Dana Example\\\"},\\\"to\\\":[{\\\"email\\\":\\\"me@example.test\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sam Example\\\"}],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\\"sent_at\\\":\\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\\"unread\\\":true,\\\"labels\\\":[\\\"INBOX\\\",\\\"UNREAD\\\"],\\\"body\\\":{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Hi Sam,\\\\n\\\\nCan you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review? Finance wants the Q3 travel line.\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nDana\\\",\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"limit_chars\\\":20000},\\\"attachments\\\":[]}]}}\\n{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"calendar\\\",\\\"result\\\":{\\\"events\\\":[{\\\"event\\\":\\\"evt_58f91c1571a642c5\\\",\\\"tit